---
import {
  ArrowLeft,
  ExternalLink,
  FileText,
  FolderKanban,
  GitFork,
  LogOut,
  Plus,
  RefreshCw,
  Save
} from "@lucide/astro";
import logoImage from "../../../../engineering/design/logo2.png";
import "@/styles/global.css";
import "@/styles/admin.css";
import "@/styles/admin-about.css";

const logoSrc = typeof logoImage === "string" ? logoImage : logoImage.src;
const contentSecurityPolicy = [
  "default-src 'self'",
  "base-uri 'none'",
  "connect-src 'self' https://api.github.com",
  "font-src 'self'",
  "frame-ancestors 'none'",
  "img-src 'self' data: https://avatars.githubusercontent.com",
  "object-src 'none'",
  "script-src 'self'",
  "style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'"
].join("; ");
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive" />
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content={contentSecurityPolicy} />
    <title>About 구성 | Content Studio</title>
    <meta name="description" content="About 페이지의 구성 요소와 내용을 관리합니다." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body class="admin-page about-admin-page">
    <header class="admin-topbar">
      <a class="admin-brand focus-ring" href="/" aria-label="블로그 홈으로 이동">
        <img src={logoSrc} alt="" />
        <span>
          <strong>Content Studio</strong>
          <small>About page builder</small>
        </span>
      </a>
      <div class="admin-session" id="admin-session" hidden>
        <a class="admin-nav-link focus-ring" href="/admin/">
          <FileText size={16} aria-hidden="true" /> 게시글 관리
        </a>
        <a class="admin-nav-link focus-ring" href="/admin/projects/">
          <FolderKanban size={16} aria-hidden="true" /> Projects 설정
        </a>
        <a
          id="viewer-link"
          class="admin-viewer focus-ring"
          href="https://github.com/JinYong-Jeong"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          <img id="viewer-avatar" alt="" />
          <span id="viewer-login">JinYong-Jeong</span>
        </a>
        <button class="icon-button focus-ring" id="logout-button" type="button" title="로그아웃">
          <LogOut size={18} aria-hidden="true" />
          <span class="sr-only">로그아웃</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="admin-main about-admin-main">
      <section class="admin-gate panel" id="about-auth-view" hidden>
        <div class="gate-icon"><GitFork size={27} aria-hidden="true" /></div>
        <p class="admin-eyebrow">Owner access only</p>
        <h1>GitHub 로그인이 필요합니다.</h1>
        <p>게시글 관리 화면에서 로그인한 뒤 About 구성으로 이동해 주세요.</p>
        <p class="gate-message" id="about-auth-message" role="alert" hidden></p>
        <a class="primary-button" href="/admin/">
          <ArrowLeft size={16} aria-hidden="true" /> 게시글 관리에서 로그인
        </a>
      </section>

      <section class="about-admin-panel panel" id="about-app" hidden>
        <div class="about-admin-header">
          <div>
            <p class="admin-eyebrow">Page components</p>
            <h1>About 페이지 구성</h1>
            <p>구성 요소를 추가·수정·삭제하고 표시 위치와 순서를 직접 정할 수 있습니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-admin-actions">
            <a class="secondary-button focus-ring" href="/about/" target="_blank">
              <ExternalLink size={16} aria-hidden="true" /> 현재 페이지
            </a>
            <button class="secondary-button focus-ring" id="reload-about-button" type="button">
              <RefreshCw size={16} aria-hidden="true" /> 새로고침
            </button>
            <button class="primary-button focus-ring" id="save-about-button" type="button">
              <Save size={16} aria-hidden="true" /> 구성 저장
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-page-fields">
          <label class="field">
            <span>브라우저 제목</span>
            <input id="about-page-title" type="text" maxlength="80" required />
          </label>
          <label class="field field-wide">
            <span>검색 결과 설명</span>
            <textarea id="about-page-description" rows="2" maxlength="180" required></textarea>
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="about-builder-toolbar">
          <div>
            <h2>구성 요소</h2>
            <p id="about-block-summary">구성을 불러오는 중…</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-add-controls">
            <label class="sr-only" for="about-block-type">추가할 구성 요소 종류</label>
            <select id="about-block-type">
              <option value="text">텍스트</option>
              <option value="list">목록</option>
              <option value="tags">태그</option>
              <option value="timeline">경력 · 실적</option>
              <option value="links">링크</option>
              <option value="profile">프로필</option>
            </select>
            <button class="secondary-button focus-ring" id="add-about-block-button" type="button">
              <Plus size={16} aria-hidden="true" /> 추가
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block-list" id="about-block-list" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div class="page-empty-state" id="about-block-empty" hidden>
          구성 요소가 없습니다. 위에서 원하는 종류를 선택해 추가하세요.
        </div>
        <p class="about-save-note">저장하면 GitHub에 변경 기록이 남고 사이트 재배포가 자동으로 시작됩니다.</p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <div class="admin-toast" id="admin-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <script src="../../../scripts/admin-about.ts"></script>
  </body>
</html>
